    "summary": "Costs 2 CP. Wait for an enemy to nominate [Fight phase](vsdata:core-rule/fight-phase) targets. Protect one it picked, from **MUTILATORS**, **OBLITERATORS** or **HERETIC ASTARTES TERMINATOR** units. Damage drops by 1 on attacks allocated to the protected unit for the rest of this turn. If a unit receives either [Armour of Corruption](vsdata:ability/chaos-space-marines.warpstrike-champions.armour-of-corruption) or [Empyric Dislocation](vsdata:ability/chaos-space-marines.warpstrike-champions.empyric-dislocation), the other is unavailable to it that phase.",
